#: main.ui:280
#| msgid ""
#| "Here you can enable or disable the virtual corner barrier between "
#| "screens. The barrier prevents the cursor from moving to another screen "
#| "when it is already touching a screen corner. This makes it easier to "
#| "trigger user interface elements like maximized windows' close buttons "
#| "when using multiple screens."
msgid "Here you can enable or disable the virtual corner barrier between screens. The barrier prevents the pointer from moving to another screen when it is already touching a screen corner. This makes it easier to trigger user interface elements like maximized windows' close buttons when using multiple screens."
msgstr ""

